# Project Structure

- **Source**: `src/` — React app (main.jsx, App.jsx, components, index.css)
- **Data**: `public/site.json` — content, projects, patents, press, publications (loaded at runtime)
- **Assets**: `public/timo_1.png`, `public/work-images/` — served at root
- **Agent files**: `public/llms.txt`, `llms-full.txt`, `sitemap.xml`, `robots.txt`, page `.md`, `404.md`
- **Build**: `npm run build` (generates agent files, then Vite) → `dist/`
- **Edit content** in `public/site.json`, then `npm run generate:agent`
- **Edit styles** in `src/index.css`
- **Do not** edit `dist/` — it is overwritten on each build
- **Do not** add a SPA catch-all rewrite — unknown paths must stay HTTP 404

## Key paths

- `public/site.json` — content, projects, patents, press, publications
- `public/llms.txt` — agent index (llms.txt v2, includes When to use this)
- `public/timo_1.png` — nav photo
- `public/work-images/*.png` — project images
- `src/components/` — Nav, AboutSection, PrinciplesSection, WorksSection, WorkDetail, PatentsSection, PressSection, TalksSection, ArticlesSection, TrustPage
- `src/utils/imageMap.js` — IMAGE_FILENAME_MAP, getProjectImageUrl, formatProjectTitle
- `src/utils/siteIdentity.js` — JSON-LD, prerender HTML, markdown, sitemap
- `middleware.js` — Accept: text/markdown negotiation and agent 404s
